            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Vargouille Transformation"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "**Vargouille Transformation**\nDC: 18\nSaving Throw: Fortitude\n- Stage 1: carrier with no effect (1d6 hours)\n- Stage 2: victim's hair falls out (1d6 hours)\n- Stage 3: victim's ears grow into leathery wings, tentacles sprout on the chin and scalp, and the teeth become long, pointed fangs (1 day)\n- Stage 4: victim's mind regresses to a vicious and unintelligent shell of its former self (1d6 hours)\n- Stage 5: victim's head breaks free of the body (which dies)"
            },
